<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ralston Purina upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ralston Purina upped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Tuesday it had raised its rating for Ralston Purina Co to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch also kept its rating of long-term buy for the company.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the pet food company closed Monday at 85-11/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
